        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "That\u2019s an interesting sword you're holding. Do you mind if I
          take a look? It doesn\u2019t look like it's made from any iron or metal.
          Is this made out of obsidian? "
